  "request": "#930 w40 · show the rest of a bug folder (P3). A bug folder is no longer just assessment, fix and test: the logreduce extension writes evidence.md before assess, agents can write extra reports, and a Source field may hold a tracker URL. Proposed: in apps/vscode/src/features/reports/reportSet.ts, show evidence.md and any other .md in the bug folder as extra tabs, and render a Source URL as a tracker link through safeUrl.\n#930 w38 · bug Story uses file write times when headers carry dates only (P3). Bug report headers carry day-only dates, so the Story says Reported, Fixed and Tested on one day for a repair that took 39 seconds. Proposed: in apps/vscode/src/features/reports/bugStory.ts, fed through reportMeta.ts, when a header has a date only, use the report's write time and show the duration, labelled as written on this machine.\nOwner picked option 2: build the four small P3s before the release.",
